msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Среда"

#: class-drushfs-shipping-method.php:100
msgid "Demo (sameday-api-bg.demo.zitec.com)"
msgstr "Демо (sameday-api-bg.demo.zitec.com)"

#: class-drushfs-shipping-method.php:101
msgid "Production (api.sameday.bg)"
msgstr "Продукционна (api.sameday.bg)"

#: class-drushfs-shipping-method.php:104
msgid ""
"Demo and production have separate credentials. Waybills created on demo are "
"not real shipments."
msgstr ""
"Демо и продукционната среда имат отделни данни за достъп. Товарителниците в "
"демо средата не са реални пратки."

